    "turn_text": "Well, that's a pretty good track record if you think about 40 years. And Senator, one thing I really enjoyed, you know, as I go around and visit with our members, Farm Bureau members, I always remember to tell them, you know, not every member of Congress or Senator has an agricultural background, but Senator Blunt does, and he can milk a cow. Isn't that right?",
