    "turn_idx": 101,
    "turn_text": "Absolutely. Well, we certainly appreciate your leadership on that. I know you and Congressman Graves both have been very, very strong advocates for those who were devastated by that flooding and who had been devastated in previous floods as well. Senator, I know we're wrapping up our time together, kind of bumping up on the end of our episode here. So we've covered a lot of heavy topics and certainly there's a lot of serious issues that have faced us in 2020 and in 2019 as well. So I want to move on to something a little bit lighter and we're going to ask our Missouri Farm Bureau question of the week. And some background for you is we actually started this by calling it the quarantine question, which was we were doing the podcast from home and trying to do something fun and, you know, try to get to know our hosts and our listeners just a little bit better. So this week's question of the week, keep in mind for our listeners, we're recording this on the 1st of October. So this episode will be released later this month. But we have officially entered October, which means that every time I open social media, everybody's talking about pumpkin spice. So, Senator Blunt, what is your favorite fall-themed drink?",
